And how do they even put their pants on in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:38.340 --> 00:01:44.580
morning? How do you balance a checkbook if you are&nbsp;
so ignorant about just basic things you're being&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:44.580 --> 00:01:49.860
lied to on? I have no problem as a commentary on&nbsp;
this program saying stuff like that. And in fact,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:49.860 --> 00:01:54.120
I've said there's really three main groups of&nbsp;
Trump voters. There are people who just don't&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:54.120 --> 00:01:57.900
know what the hell is going on. They don't know.&nbsp;
They don't know what Trump policies are. They just&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:57.900 --> 00:02:01.500
don't know anything. And they were kind of like&nbsp;
