00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:08.220
There's people who are what we might call like&nbsp;
bad people. They do understand the Trump policy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:08.220 --> 00:02:11.400
and they understand all of the things that&nbsp;
happened as a result and all the people that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:15.600
Trump policy is terrible for and they say, I&nbsp;
like it and I'm going to vote for him anyway.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:16.260 --> 00:02:21.840
And then you've got the third group, which is&nbsp;
people who vote for Trump out of some selfish&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:22.440 --> 00:02:27.660
priority. Well, yeah, I understand exactly who&nbsp;
and what Trump is, but his tax plan would save&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:31.140
