are the main three groups of Trump voters. I've&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:31.140 --> 00:02:35.160
been totally upfront about that, so I have&nbsp;
no issue about shows like mine doing that.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:35.160 --> 00:02:44.280
On the other hand, I am aware that as a matter of&nbsp;
pragmatics and effectively deprogramming people&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.280 --> 00:02:51.900
from, for example, Trumpism. If I were running&nbsp;
a campaign right. And I was Trump's opponent,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:56.100
I don't think that shaming Trump voters&nbsp;
would be the right way to win them over.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:56.100 --> 00:03:03.000
Right. I would take an approach that would be&nbsp;
something more like, listen, I understand that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:08.400
